stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> retain
  retain --> observe: review trigger + owner
  observe --> candidate: all hard gates + evidence
  candidate --> approved: named functional approvals
  approved --> executing: DP8 + DP9 ready
  executing --> extracted: migration + acceptance
  observe --> retain: evidence insufficient
  candidate --> retain: hard gate fails
  approved --> retain: rollback / approval withdrawn
  executing --> retain: safe rollback to modular monolith
